<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JUD" style="id">JUT - Lamma</book>
  <para style="toc1">Sẽẽkoo Au Shɛ A JUTI Naa</para>
  <para style="toc2">Jut</para>
  <para style="toc3">Jt</para>
  <para style="mt2">Sẽẽkoo Au shɛ a</para>
  <para style="mt1">JUTI Naa</para>
  <para style="imt">Yutasinɛ</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk">Sẽẽkoo au shɛ a Juti naa </char>shɔ beerɛ aru shɔu gɔ̃ shɔmala nyayeelinɛyi yusho ai tuunɛ i pɛ shɔ sisɨn ãnɛyi. A jaa sẽẽkoom, au pɛ nazɔ gbete a vibeenɛ e<char style="bk">Bituru e ziti yɛni</char>, shɔ vi beenɛm masi shɔ ɓalinɛyi bitɔ &lt;&lt;nɛi yɛ ɗekɨn a bawaanɛ aru sisɨn ãnɛni nɔgbete piti kpai, a vi Ɗalapa ãu shɔbiiyɛ.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="iot">Vi au ɓuzɨn yɛ</para>
  <para style="io1">Vitasinɛ (1-2)</para>
  <para style="io1">Vipɛlinɛ, vimatinɛ, a shɔmala nyayeelinɛyi matinɛ (3-16)</para>
  <para style="io1">Yusho gɔ̃nɛ aru sisɨn ãnɛ sãna (17-23)</para>
  <para style="io1">Ɗa gakinɛ (24-25)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JUD 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JUD 1:1" />Sẽkoom shɛ pɛ ang naa Yahuda, Yesɔ Kirisi foo, Yakub ɓɛzɔ̃.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JUD 1:1">N beeri shɔ gbete Ɗalapa ɓainyayɛ, shɔyi ɔ̃ a ɓuzɨn Ɗalapa u Ɓeye ɔrinɛ, au ɔrɔɔ yɛ a sɨnwɔ Yesɔ Kirisi naa u kɔ wɔɔtɔ:<verse eid="JUD 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JUD 1:2" />Mɛnɛ raantanɛ, ɔ̃nɛbiinyatɔ̃nɛ a ɔrinɛ u ɔ̃ ɔ ɓɛɛ piti kpai.<verse eid="JUD 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Shɔmala Nyayeelinyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JUD 1:3" />N shɔbiiyi ang ɔriyɛ, sin mabiitɛ n-tɛ n beerɔɔtɔ aru u raanɛnkɔ kpai, ama n zɛrɛ ɔ̃tɛ kaka jazɨng akɔrɔ n beerɔɔtɔ n masɔɔbiirɛ ɔ yɛ ɗekɨn aru sisɨn ãnɛ, a Ɗalapa ãu shɔbii wɔsɔ wɔsɔyi ɓa gbete sheeli. <verse eid="JUD 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JUD 1:4" />N sha vim aru shɔ gbeteyi gɨn Ɗalapa ɓa, i totɛ au tete a nyanɛ, i sɔɔri Ɗa tɔ̃vɨn shonɛtɛ riitɛ nyaba vikɔ̃linɛ pɛlinɛ, Yesɔ kirisi kɔ u yupɛ̃ni sheeli i ɓɛ̃ɛ̃utɛ a Uɓeyelapani. Laabeenɛ Ɗanyaruubii sha si tɛttɔ tɛ̃ɛ̃tɛ̃ɛ̃ nɛ shɔ ɗɔmiyi yɛ ranaa ɓa, . <verse eid="JUD 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JUD 1:5" />N kasirɛ n kpaarɔɔ sisɨntɔ, ɔ zɛ vim tɛttɔ kpai, Uɓeyelapa gaa shɔ Israila i ranaa a tipi Masara, ama akɨnti a nyoki shɔ gbeteyi ji a sisɨn ɓau biini ɓarɛ. <verse eid="JUD 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JUD 1:6" />Ɔ kpaa sisɨntɔ ɗajashonɛlapa shɔgbete i ji shi ɓa ɗɔgbeteyi kaka vishonɛ ɗɔnyɛni ɓa: Ɗalapa mayi dɔɔtɛ a saa gãnya a ɗɔkɨnri au sɔ̃nyaɓa, i ɗɔyi ga Lee ruuyeenɛyɛ. <verse eid="JUD 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JUD 1:7" />Ɔ kpaa sisɨn sɔ̃ntɔ aru Sɔdom a Gumora ni, a komoo gbete si maani a ikɔyini, au shɔ pɛli kpãntang a vikɔ̃linɛni aɗɔn fɛ̃ɛm yɛ: komoowi shɔ lɛsiyi a yaa gbete sɔ̃nyaɓayɛ u tasi naa yushogɔ̃nɛ a shɔbii piti kpai. <verse eid="JUD 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JUD 1:8" />Si jo nankɔ, shɔgbete i bassi Ɗalapa ɓa miyi i pɛli vikɔ̃linɛ i shanɛ Ɗalapa tasiyi a nɔrinɛ nɛi pɛli jo nankɔ, aru nankɔ i pɔ̃yi bi ɔ̃ ɓa wɔsɔ-wɔsɔ ɓa, i gɨn Ɗalapa nya shanɛ ɓa, i shali vikɔ̃linɛ aru vi kolapayini. <verse eid="JUD 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JUD 1:9" />Ko Ɗajashonɛlapa pɛ̃niba Maikɛl ji sha vim si ɓa, a ɗɔyi mari zɔ a shɔruuvini yɛ, aru Musa vɔrɔ, Maikɛli ji dã shɔruuvini ɓa a yeeruu au yuuni ɓa, ama shanɛ, &lt;&lt;Uɓeyelapa u lasaatɔ!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JUD 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JUD 1:10" />Ama shɔmiyi, vigbete ai ji zɛɓa i dãutɔ.Vigbete i zɛyɛnkɔ ukɔ yɛ lɛsiyirɛ aru i lɛriɓa naa vivaayi, i pɛli jo vi ayi kasiyɛ ukɔ yɛ ɔ̃rɛ i nyaba lɛsinɛ. <verse eid="JUD 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JUD 1:11" />Kee, yɛ ɔ̃riyi kɛpikoviyaǃ I gɨn Kayino vishonɛtɛ, aru saa kasinɛ i pɛlitɛ naa Balaam pɛli si yɛ. i si naa kora ji gɨn u yupɛ̃niyi nya ɓa, lɛsirɛ aru yulakinɛ, shɔ yɛ lɛsi shomiyi tɔ piti naa shɔ lɛsi Kora yɛ. <verse eid="JUD 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JUD 1:12" />Shɔmiyi i yusẽ ɓa yuuni ɓa, i naa vizizi a yɛti vishaanɛ yumusinɛ, i naa jagavivayi ai shaari i yuukɔ sheeli. I naa sabu gbete sɔrɔ siiyɛ au n ti mii ɓayɛ. I naa laau waatitɛyɛ, shɔ aatɔ aru i jaa ɓa yuuni ɓa. I vɔkɛ ɓa ziti. <verse eid="JUD 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JUD 1:13" />I naa rii mii waapo ai viyuusẽ i pɛliyɛni i ãbiilapa naa pupuru. I naa sɛyi ai rakiyɛ, a Ɗalapa yaasiyi ɗɔkɨnri gbikiri-gbikiri tɛ dangdang. <verse eid="JUD 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JUD 1:14" />Si jo Ɛnɔki kɔ shɔzɛ e maanzii a Adamu laduru, si tɛ̃ɛ̃tɛ̃ɛ̃ nwanya ayuu vimiyiyuu nɛː &lt;&lt;Uɓeyelapa yɛ atɔ au Ɗajashonɛlapa Wɔsɔ-wɔsɔyini laazɔrɔ-laazɔrɔ <verse eid="JUD 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JUD 1:15" />u yeeruu a shɔ kotipi i yuu kpai, u lɛsiyirɛ aru i vipɛlinɛ ɓa Ɗalapa nii ɓa, a ruu kɔ̃linɛ ayi nwali au yuuyɛni piti kpai!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JUD 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JUD 1:16" />Shɔmiyi i pɛ shɔ sɔ̃ɔ̃nɔlinɛyi ai tasi janaa a shɔ biiyɛ, i gɨn ɓɛɛ jo vikɔ̃linɛ ai bi kasiyɛ; i nwanya ai yubasinɛ i bɛli shɔwɔyi aru i kpaa viyi kasiyɛ.<verse eid="JUD 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yushogɔ̃nɛ a Nyakɔsinɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JUD 1:17" />Ama n shɔ ɔrinɛyi ɔ kpaa sisɨn pɛ, aru vigbete Uɓeyelapa Yesɔ Kirisi jashonɛ i gelɔɔ si a kɨntiyɛ. <verse eid="JUD 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JUD 1:18" />I gelɔɔ nɛ, a leegbete koo yisinyayɛ, shɔwɔyi i yɛ latitɔ aru tɔ̃vɨn shonɛ, i gɨn jo i vi kasinɛ gbete ɓa e Ɗalapa ɓa. <verse eid="JUD 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JUD 1:19" />Shɔmpɛ shɔgbete i n ti yuu vɔsinɛrɛ, i Suru ɓa ɗɔn ɓa, ɓa Ɗa Suru tesiyi ɗekɨn rɛ ɓa. <verse eid="JUD 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JUD 1:20" />Ama n shɔ ɔrinɛyi, ɔ yɛ ɗekɨn awɔ yuɓassinɛni a nyaba sisɨn ãnɛ. Ɔ gaki Ɗa a Suru wɔsɔ-wɔsɔ kaka, <verse eid="JUD 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JUD 1:21" />ɔ ã yuu a Ɗalapa ɔrinɛ, nagbete ɔ ga Uɓeyelapa Yesɔ Kirisi au tete raantanɛ u ãwɔ suru au sɔ̃nyaɓayɛ.<verse eid="JUD 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JUD 1:22" />Ɔ nta shɔyi sisɨn bɔ̃tɔ i raatɔ; <verse eid="JUD 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JUD 1:23" />ɔ raa shɔ gãsiyitɔ ɔ gɔ̃yi a yaa ɔ shɛshi ɓili, zɔ gãsiyi ɔ ntayi raatɔ ɔ ɓasi a seti ntanɛni, ama ɔ bɛ̃ɛ i fãrãtɔ, au ruuvini lɛsitɛ aka yɛ.<verse eid="JUD 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɗagakinɛ E Bɛlinɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JUD 1:24" />Ɔ bɛli Ɗalapa tɔ , shɔgbete zɛwɔnɔɔ kɔnɛtɛ ɔ nwesi ɓa ruuvini niɓa, yɛ n-tɔɔtɔ yɛnɛ u ɗɔ bassinɛ a kolapa ɔ nwesi ɓa ruuvini ɓa, yɛ n-tɔɔ ɗɔwakɔ ɔ nta sisɨn puru fɛ̃ɛm. <verse eid="JUD 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JUD 1:25" />Ɔ bɛliutɔ pɛ ukɔ sheeli Ɗalapa u shɔshɔraanɛ. Bassinɛ, kpati, kaka vishonɛ a kaka shɔ sãnɛ pɛu ɓɛɛkɔ, u bɛliunɛ aka Yesɔ Kirisi Uɓeyelapa. U bɛlinɛ si ji tɛ̃ɛ̃tɛ̃ɛ̃ kopiɗaviya, anɛ dɔdɔrim, yɛ ɔ̃ dangdang.<verse eid="JUD 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JUD 1" />
</usx>